"Kho^ng the^? thoa't ra ddu'ng . \n"
"kho^ng the^? lie^n la.c vo+'i tri`nh qua?n li' session . Ba.n co' the^? thu+? e'p"
"shutdown ba(`ng ca'ch nha^'n CTRL, ALT va` BACKSPACE ddo^`ng tho+`i ."
"Chu' y' la` tuy va^.y, session hie^.n ta.i se~ kho^ng ddu+o+.c ca^'t ne^'u e'p shutdown."

